---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About - Anirban Dam"
	description="Anirban Dam is a VLSI & Emulation Engineer and robotics hobbyist who designs hardware flows, automates chip design methodology, and shares what he learns across code, circuits, and content."
>
	<section class="mx-auto flex min-h-[60vh] max-w-2xl flex-col justify-center px-6 py-20">
		<p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-display text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-primary uppercase">
			<span class="h-0.5 w-8 rounded-full bg-coral" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			About</p>
		<h1 class="mt-3 text-balance font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-6xl">
			Anirban Dam
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text/80">
			A VLSI &amp; Emulation Engineer by profession and robotics hobbyist by passion. I design
			hardware flows, automate chip design methodology, and share what I learn across code,
			circuits, and content.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text/80">
			<span class="rounded bg-blush px-1.5 font-semibold text-primary box-decoration-clone">Learn deeply, simplify clearly, share generously</span>
			- that's the approach, whether I'm automating chip design flows, building robotics projects,
			or diving into new tools.
		</p>
		<a
			href="/contact"
			class="mt-10 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-canvas shadow-lg shadow-primary/25 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-xl focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-canvas"
		>
			Get in Touch
		</a>
	</section>
</Layout>
